# ModelFile（oobsum/specs/SPEC-0033）：YAML 模型表合并进内置表；坏条目跳过并提示；Dump=models；读不了 → 选项错误。
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# 配了 extra.yaml：Drv_Copy（访问）、Pool_Get（分配器）的越界报 DEFINITE，Stat_Inc（^Stat_ 纯函数）不记账
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ModelFile=%S/Inputs/models/extra.yaml \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=models+stats %S/Inputs/models/use.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=FILE
# 不配：三处都是 not_in_tu / 入口记账（SUSPECT）
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -fno-signed-char -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:InlineDepth=0 %S/Inputs/models/use.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=NOFILE
# 示例文件 = 内置表（按内容比，顺序不论：合并时同名条目先删后加；lower 的内部调用 __oobsum_copy 不在示例文件里也总在，SPEC-0051）
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=models %S/Inputs/models/use.c 2>&1 | grep 'oobsum:models' | grep -v ' source ' | sort > %t/builtin
# RUN: %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ModelFile=%S/../../../../oobsum/config/oob_models.example.yaml \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:Dump=models %S/Inputs/models/use.c > %t/example.out 2>&1
# RUN: grep 'oobsum:models' %t/example.out | grep -v ' source ' | sort | diff %t/builtin -
# RUN: not grep 'warning: ModelFile' %t/example.out
# 读不了 → 选项错误
# RUN: not %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ModelFile=%t/missing.yaml %S/Inputs/models/use.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MISSING
# RUN: printf 'alocators: []\n' > %t/typo.yaml
# RUN: not %clang_analyze_cc1 -triple armebv7-linux-gnueabi -analyzer-checker=rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary \
# RUN:   -analyzer-config rb.enhance.ipa.OobSummary:ModelFile=%t/typo.yaml %S/Inputs/models/use.c 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=TYPO

FILE: [oobsum] warning: ModelFile {{.*}}extra.yaml: access 'Drv_Fill': bytes 'n': 'n' is not an argument (p0, p1, ...), skipped
FILE: [oobsum] warning: ModelFile {{.*}}extra.yaml: allocators 'Pool_GetOut': result 'p1' is not supported (only ret), skipped
FILE: [oobsum:models] source default+{{.*}}extra.yaml
FILE: [oobsum:models] access Drv_Copy W p0[p1] R p2[p1]
FILE: [oobsum:models] alloc Pool_Get size=p0*4
FILE: [oobsum:models] pure pattern ^Stat_
FILE-NOT: Drv_Fill
FILE: [oobsum:stats] tu={{[0-9a-f]+}} decisions=4 emitted=2
FILE-DAG: use.c:18:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 32 of 'buf' (16 bytes) is accessed
FILE-DAG: use.c:32:1: warning: [OOB-DEFINITE] Definite out-of-bound write through a 1-level call chain: up to byte 20 of heap object allocated at use.c:28 (16 bytes) is accessed
FILE-NOT: OOB-SUSPECT

NOFILE-DAG: use.c:12:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:not_in_tu] Cannot prove this access is within bounds: a pointer is passed to 'Drv_Copy'
NOFILE-DAG: use.c:32:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:untracked_pointer]
NOFILE-DAG: use.c:37:1: warning: [OOB-SUSPECT:not_in_tu] Cannot prove this access is within bounds: a pointer is passed to 'Stat_Inc'

